[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8280.549, "timestamp": "02:18:00", "text": "私も似たような経験をしました"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8285.03, "timestamp": "02:18:05", "text": "人を好きになり、何人かを知るために、これらすべてをします"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8287.95, "timestamp": "02:18:07", "text": "えっと、私が試したからだと思うんだけど"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8291.75, "timestamp": "02:18:11", "text": "新しい人を招待する、つまり私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8295.11, "timestamp": "02:18:15", "text": "最初はもっと好きになり始めた"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8296.95, "timestamp": "02:18:16", "text": "今から日本に行くので。だから私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8299.11, "timestamp": "02:18:19", "text": "もっと日本の友達を作ろうと思ったのですが、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8302.389, "timestamp": "02:18:22", "text": "日本のユーチューバーっぽい。それから私はいくつかのことに気づいた"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8305.589, "timestamp": "02:18:25", "text": "彼らの中にはそれを"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8308.95, "timestamp": "02:18:28", "text": "深刻な性転換症のようなもの"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8311.75, "timestamp": "02:18:31", "text": "それらは開いていないようです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8313.669, "timestamp": "02:18:33", "text": "フレンドリーですよね？一部の人だけが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8318.23, "timestamp": "02:18:38", "text": "右。ああ、ごめんなさい。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8321.11, "timestamp": "02:18:41", "text": "ええ、どうぞ。どうぞ。いやいや、君が行くよ"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 8321.919, "timestamp": "02:18:41", "author": "@rudratiwari8543", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_kTnTV5MpIhweGe_pzwsKp471uZ-E1ks3cSA76oHUxgBQ=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "arre yash bhai namaste kya hal chal apkeUCdZBnUb7m8Pd_wUTDNqUu3Q/f3TlZ5L1KpS3_9EP-duW6Qo"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8323.429, "timestamp": "02:18:43", "text": "先に。私はあなたとの連絡を断ちました。それは私のミスです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8325.669, "timestamp": "02:18:45", "text": "いや、いや、いや、いや、いや。私は行くつもりだった 私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8327.83, "timestamp": "02:18:47", "text": "何も言わないつもりだ。うん、君、君"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8331.87, "timestamp": "02:18:51", "text": "今ならできる。ああ、わかりました。私は何人か知っています"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8334.03, "timestamp": "02:18:54", "text": "人々は"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 8336.889, "timestamp": "02:18:56", "author": "@yashchourasia2215", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_mbRu2gYmpEUO4nLl0jA2optOzbTHvVFqZhza3dfpPmwg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "@Rudra Tiwari i am gud, wbu??"}]